    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37696" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prae-lībo</span></b> , āre,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v.a.</i>, <i>to taste beforehand</i>, <i>foretaste</i> (<b>poet.</b>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nectar,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					S. 3, 4, 60</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vultus ac pectora Ulysses Praelibat visu,</span>”
				<i>examines</i>, <i>inspects</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Stat. Achill. 2, 88</span></i>
			.</div>
